<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Oct 23.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Oct 23.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
